      "orig_text": "遍く本の、\n１ページ。\n総てを映す、\n水晶玉の内側。"
    },
    {
      "name": "？？？",
      "text": "My space, borrowed from the Alsephina.\nAn observation base from which to peer into a universe different from \"this\" one.\n...Something like that.",
